{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42438","headline":"鼎臣学士侍郎以东馆庭梅昔翰苑之毫末今复半枯向时同僚零落都尽素𩬇垂领兹唯二人感旧伤怀发於吟咏惠然好我不能无言輙次来韵攀 · 汤悦","name":"鼎臣学士侍郎以东馆庭梅昔翰苑之毫末今复半枯向时同僚零落都尽素𩬇垂领兹唯二人感旧伤怀发於吟咏惠然好我不能无言輙次来韵攀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆见萌芽日，还怜合抱时。\n旧欢如梦想，物态暗还移。\n素艳今无几，朱颜亦自衰。\n树将人共老，何暇更悲丝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"汤悦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42438.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42438","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}